---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PostList from '../components/PostList.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
import {site} from '../data/site';
import {projects} from '../data/projects';
import {getPosts} from '../data/posts';
const posts=(await getPosts()).slice(0,2);
---
<SiteLayout><section class="hero container"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="blue-line"></span> AUTONOMOUS SYSTEMS & ROBOTICS</div><p class="hero-intro">你好，我是</p><h1>Leyan Liu<span>.</span></h1><h2>探索自主系统，<br/>连接智能与真实世界。</h2><p class="hero-description">关注无人机、机器人与智能控制。<br/>在这里记录研究思考、技术实践，以及不断学习的过程。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/blog/">阅读科研笔记 ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">探索研究方向 →</a></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><div class="visual-label">FIG. 01 / TRAJECTORY EXPLORATION</div><img src="/images/trajectory.svg" width="600" height="490" alt="蓝色规划轨迹在坐标系中绕过障碍的概念示意图" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="visual-caption"><span class="live-dot"></span> 从模型到行动，从仿真到现实 <span>01 — 03</span></div></div></section><div class="interest-strip"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">RESEARCH FOCUS</span><span>无人机自主系统</span><span>机器人学</span><span>轨迹规划与控制</span><span>具身智能</span></div></div>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / RESEARCH INTERESTS</div><h2>从问题出发，探索可能。</h2></div><p>以自主系统为线索，<br/>理解感知、决策与控制之间的联系。</p></div><div class="research-grid"><div><span class="research-symbol">⌁</span><h3>自主飞行与协同</h3><p>无人机自主系统 · 多无人机协同<br/>从单体控制走向多智能体协作。</p></div><div><span class="research-symbol">↗</span><h3>规划与智能控制</h3><p>轨迹规划 · 模型预测控制<br/>在动力学与约束之间寻找可行路径。</p></div><div><span class="research-symbol">◈</span><h3>机器人与学习</h3><p>机器人学 · 强化学习 · 具身智能<br/>探索学习型方法与物理世界的交互。</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section tinted"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / FEATURED DIRECTIONS</div><h2>研究主题</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">查看全部主题 ↗</a></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.slice(0,3).map((project,index)=><ProjectCard project={project} index={index}/>)}</div><p class="section-note">以下为关注的研究方向；具体成果与代码将在核实后补充。</p></div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">03 / LATEST NOTES</div><h2>最近的思考与记录</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">所有文章 ↗</a></div><PostList posts={posts}/></section><section class="about-band container"><div class="eyebrow">04 / A LITTLE ABOUT ME</div><div><h2>把好奇心，变成持续的探索。</h2><p>这里是我的个人学术主页与科研博客。我关心自主系统如何在真实世界中可靠地行动，也希望用清晰的文字记录学习过程中的理解与问题。</p><div class="tags">{site.technologies.map(t=><span>{t}</span>)}</div><a class="text-link" href="/about/">更多关于我 ↗</a></div></section></SiteLayout>
